# UrbanMind

Real-Time Big Data Platform for Urban Intelligence and Predictive Decision Support.

## Objectives

- Collect urban data
- Process large-scale datasets
- Generate AI predictions
- Visualize insights

## Tech Stack

Frontend:
React

Backend:
FastAPI

Big Data:
Spark
Kafka

Database:
MongoDB

Deployment:
Docker

